<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s answer could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= set.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The answer did not match the expected shape or broke one of this feature&rsquo;s rules (nothing past your
    chapter, never a hint that anyone is behind, no links). Try again, or edit the template in the admin panel to
    tighten the instructions.
  </p>
  <%= render "book_picks/openers_button", book_pick: book_pick, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
